; -----------------------------------------------------------------
; Soldier Fiend's Giresta object snapshots the whole of Plane A into
; $FFFF2400 (loc_24A08, 40 words per row) while the enemy action-name
; window (plane rows 1-3, columns 2-13) is still open.  loc_B54A closes
; that window by restoring rows 1-3 from the snapshot, so the window's
; own tiles must not be in it.  The original loop cleared 7 longs and
; skipped $38 - a $54 stride over a $50-byte row, leaving the left edge
; of rows 2-3 - and the US build dropped the call after the second
; snapshot, so the window came back whole as it "closed".  Clear rows
; 0-3, columns 0-15, at the real stride.
