; ==================================================================
;         Skill Data
;
; Byte 1: Effect
;   1: damage
;   2: death
;   3: attack down
;	4: defense down
;   6: agility down
;   7: sleep
;   8: silence, as the player Seals technique
;   9: attack up
;   $A: defense up
;   $B: magic defense up
;   $C: agility up
;	$D = element resistance up
;	$E = wake up
;   $12: heal HP
;	$13: cure poison
;	$14: cure paralysis
;	$15: revive character
;	$16: full healing
;   $1B: poison
;   $1C: paralyze
;   $1D: android death
;   $21: dexterity down
;   $26: dexterity up
;   $27: restore stats
;   $2B: increase stats by 20
;
; Byte 2: Relevant statistic which affects the power of the skill. The values are as follows:
;   1: strength
;   2: mental
;   3: agility
;   4: dexterity
;   5: attack
;	6: defense
;	7: magic defense
;   bit 7 = if set, it requires a weapon to be equipped
;
; Byte 3: Targetting byte. Low nibble determines target; high nibble determines usability in and out of battle
;
;   Low nibble:
;   	1: Single enemy
;   	2: All enemies
;   	3: Self
;   	4: Single character (humans)
;		5: All characters (humans)
;		6: Single character (androids)
;		7: All characters (androids)
;   	8: Single character
;   	9: All characters
;
;   High nibble:
;   	1 = usable only in battle
;   	2 = usable only outside of battle
;   	3 = usable both in and outside of battle
;
;
; Byte 4: Hit chance; not applicable if byte 5 is 0 or for effects such as damage and healing
;
; Byte 5: Determines which stat to use as resistance for targets
;   1: strength
;   2: mental
;   3: agility
;   4: dexterity
;   5: attack
;   6: defense
;   7: magic defense
;
; Byte 6: Element
;   1: Physical/Non-Elemental
;   2: Energy/Laser
;   3: Fire
;   4: Gravity
;   5: Water/Ice
;   6: Anti-Evil/Holy
;   7: Lightning
;   8: Holyword
;   9: Brose
;   $A: Biological
;   $B: Psychic
;   $C: Mechanical
;   $D: Efess
;   $E: Destroy/Death
;
; Byte 7: Always 0
;
; Byte 8: Always 0
; ==================================================================
