TitleText:
	dc.b	"Woven from beyond the reaches of time,", $FF
	dc.b	"the rite of souls now draws to its close.", $FF
	dc.b	"Those who came before", $FF
	dc.b	"raise it to the heavens.", $FF
	dc.b	"It tolls the knell of death.", $FF
	dc.b	"It kindles a deep-violet flame.", $FF
	dc.b	"It ushers in an endless millennium...", $FF
	dc.b	$FF
	even
TitleText2:
	dc.b	"In the heavens lies", $FF
	dc.b	"the Algol solar system...", $FF
	dc.b	"Long ago,", $FF
	dc.b	"upon its worlds,", $FF
	dc.b	"a brilliant civilization flourished.", $FF
	dc.b	"Its people surrendered themselves", $FF
	dc.b	"to prosperity and pleasure.", $FF
	dc.b	$FF
	dc.b	"But then,", $FF
	dc.b	"the planetary management system", $FF
	dc.b	"known as Mother Brain", $FF
	dc.b	"was destroyed,", $FF
	dc.b	"plunging all into chaos.", $FF
	dc.b	"The first planet, Palma,", $FF
	dc.b	"exploded and vanished.", $FF
	dc.b	"More than ninety percent", $FF
	dc.b	"of the total population perished.", $FF
	dc.b	"The old scientific civilization was lost,", $FF
	dc.b	"and the people's lives", $FF
	dc.b	"fell into poverty and hardship.", $FF
	dc.b	$FF
	dc.b	"And then, a thousand years passed...", $FF
	dc.b	$FF
	dc.b	"As the years went by,", $FF
	dc.b	"the people found new strength to live.", $FF
	dc.b	"Once again, the bud of prosperity", $FF
	dc.b	"sought to take root in Algol,", $FF
	dc.b	"but the unforgiving environment", $FF
	dc.b	"would not easily allow it...", $FF
	dc.b	$FF
	dc.b	$FF
	dc.b	$FF
